        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-10T05:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not for this CL, but: is this done inline in the MockNetworkAgent constructor? If so, I think it\u0027s not realistic since the actual creation of NetworkMonitors is asynchronous. We might want to create a new thread for this, or post it as a lambda to mHandlerThread, or move it to the fake NetworkMonitor handler thread when you add that.",
      "revId": "3f3a1e41a66eca4225a8b8a5d022f2e7cb1e5288",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
